Set MOZ_APP_DISPLAYNAME="Pyxis Vela" so the unofficial branding target builds and identifies as Pyxis Vela instead of Nightly.

════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
The unified diff below is generated from the checkout and is applied with
  git apply gecko/patches/pyxis/<path>.PYXIS_DIFF
(or `patch -p1 <`). Everything above this line is rationale, not content;
git apply ignores it. Regenerate with scripts/regen-gecko-patches.sh.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

diff --git a/browser/branding/unofficial/configure.sh b/browser/branding/unofficial/configure.sh
index edd3bd3e86e5..127019a7ca08 100644
--- a/browser/branding/unofficial/configure.sh
+++ b/browser/branding/unofficial/configure.sh
@@ -2,4 +2,4 @@
 # License, v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this
 # file, You can obtain one at http://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.
 
-MOZ_APP_DISPLAYNAME=Nightly
+MOZ_APP_DISPLAYNAME="Pyxis Vela"
